<title>INDONESIA: Daya Guna says Q1 net up to 30.5 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Daya Guna says Q1 net up to 30.5 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  30.5  vs  12.5</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rph)	   72    vs  30</p>
<p>    Net sales				 103.11  vs  44.55</p>
<p>    Gross profit			     59.43  vs  25.85</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 48.29  vs  20.66</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Daya Guna Samudera is one of Indonesia's largest fisheries companies. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
